<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450429" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 1 — Block equation</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider a &lt;math&gt; element placed between two &lt;p&gt; elements as a standalone block equation.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>equation</keyword>
        <keyword>block</keyword>
        <keyword>element</keyword>
        <keyword>MathML</keyword>
        <keyword>Scenario</keyword>
        <keyword>Block</keyword>
        <indexterm>equation</indexterm>
        <indexterm>block</indexterm>
        <indexterm>element</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>
      <section>
      <p>Consider a <codeph>&lt;math&gt;</codeph> element placed between two <codeph>&lt;p&gt;</codeph> elements as a standalone block equation.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Standalone block equation</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;p>
  The transfer rate is:
&lt;/p>
&lt;math
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"
  display="block">
  &lt;mrow>
    &lt;mi>R&lt;/mi>
    &lt;mo>=&lt;/mo>
    &lt;mfrac>
      &lt;mi>B&lt;/mi>
      &lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>
    &lt;/mfrac>
  &lt;/mrow>
&lt;/math>
&lt;p>
  where B is total bytes, and T is the elapsed time.
&lt;/p></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;p>The transfer rate is:&lt;/p>
&lt;equation-block>
  &lt;math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
    &lt;mrow>
      &lt;mi>R&lt;/mi>
      &lt;mo>=&lt;/mo>
      &lt;mfrac>
        &lt;mi>B&lt;/mi>
        &lt;mi>T&lt;/mi>
      &lt;/mfrac>
    &lt;/mrow>
  &lt;/math>
&lt;/equation-block>
&lt;p>
  where B is total bytes, and T is the elapsed time.
&lt;/p></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p><b>Result:</b> The converter detects the <codeph>&lt;math display="block"&gt;</codeph> element and wraps it in a DITA <codeph>&lt;equation-block&gt;</codeph> element. The MathML content is preserved as-is inside the <codeph>&lt;equation-block&gt;</codeph>.</p>
         </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
